# property-references-itself (#8): a property whose read/write accessor names the
# property itself recurses forever. Fires on 'property Bar ... read Bar' (line 8:
# the accessor equals the property name); NOT on 'property Baz ... read FBar write
# FBar' (line 9: accessors are the backing field, not the property).
property-references-itself 8
!property-references-itself 9
